      <h1 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-4">Chester</h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-brand-orange font-heading mb-2">The Microphone That Makes Your Upright Bass Sound Like YOUR Bass!</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Lighter. Faster to install. Tuned specifically for upright bass, on stage or in the studio.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main product + pitch -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="md:flex gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="md:w-1/2 mb-8 md:mb-0">
          <img src="/images/chester/chester-v2-mounted-front.jpg" alt="Chester V2 microphone mounted between the strings of an upright bass" class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full" />
        </div>
        <div class="md:w-1/2">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl mb-4">Built by an Upright Bassist Who Got Tired of Compromising</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Every bassist knows the struggle. Pickups don't sound natural and they quack. Clip-on mics are flimsy. Cheap condensers sound thin. Studio mics sound great, unless you're moving.
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-dark font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-4">Chester V2 solves all of that. In under 30 seconds.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            I rebuilt Chester to be lighter, faster to install, and tuned with a flat response specifically for the upright bass. The 40 Hz low cut and a natural high cut are built into the circuit, so all you need is 48V phantom power. It's plug and play and ready for the stage.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Comparable boutique upright-bass mics run $650 and up. Chester is lighter, installs in under 30 seconds, and costs a third less.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-brand-warm rounded-xl p-6 mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-1">
              <p class="font-heading font-extrabold text-4xl text-brand-dark">$449</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">with free shipping</p>
            </div>
