    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl mb-8">Musicians Tell Me the Same Thing</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 text-xl leading-relaxed">
        <p>They stop fighting their sound.</p>
        <p>They relax.</p>
        <p>They play better because they hear themselves clearly.</p>
        <p>There's a moment, usually on the first note, where they smile.</p>
      </div>

      <figure class="mt-12 bg-brand-warm rounded-xl p-8 md:p-10 relative text-left">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="font-heading text-7xl md:text-8xl text-brand-orange leading-none absolute -top-2 left-4 opacity-25 select-none">&ldquo;</span>
