  </section>

  <!-- Photo gallery -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-warm">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl mb-6 text-center">Made by Hand. Tuned by Ear.</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Every Chester is assembled by hand. Medium cardioid capsule, custom-tuned circuit, and a copper and brass body with a brass mesh grille. I tune each one individually so the sound is consistent from one mic to the next. Only the body itself may vary slightly, because it's built by hand.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
